window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The heat is on.</b></p> <p>Wyvern Pack is waiting on a few last bites to make their family whole.</p> <p>When Lilah and Orion sync heats, it's finally time to put down that last baggage and solidify their bonds—with each other and with the alphas who've been waiting to give them everything they need.</p> <p>These twelve extra-spicy chapters follow immediately after the ending of<i> Pack Darling Part Two. </i>Contains cursing, MM, and group scenes.</p>"; 
